  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help refugees live with dignity in a new place</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We teach Polish refugees from Ukraine. Knowing the basics of Polish helps them to communicate in the store, office, and job search. We run such classes in September and we know that they need to continue. We work with a qualified teacher whom the students liked. But our funds have already run out and we need support to continue. 30 people are waiting for help to learn Polish and have a better life. While adults are having lessons, their children need care - we will hire a Ukrainian art teacher.</narrative>
  </description>
